	"VersionName": "1.0.0",
	"FriendlyName": "Nanimation — Deterministic Animation Variants",
	"Description": "Modular, data-driven animation variant system for Unreal Engine 5.8. Scans the Content folder, classifies animations by naming convention, groups variants per action, and picks one via a weighted ShuffleBag (seed-replicated for multiplayer). Skeleton-agnostic. Includes an AnimGraph node with Direction/Stance filtering, an editor scanner with CSV export, and a hybrid network model (~20 bytes per pick via seed replay).",
	"Category": "Animation",
	"CreatedBy": "hanibes",
